    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yakobbo naasabira Efuraimu na Manaase omugisa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu haahingwireho akasumi, abantu baija baagambira Yosefu bati: “Sso murwaire.” Aho Yosefu yatwara abatabani babiri, yagenda nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu baagambira Yakobbo bati: “Mutabani wawe Yosefu aizire kukurora.” Nubwo Isirairi yayekwatiriza, yaikarra ha kitabu kye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.28.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 28:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.28.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yagambira Yosefu ati: “Ruhanga ow'obusobozi bwona, akambonekera ndi omu kiikaro Luuzi, omunsi Kanaani, yampa omugisa, yangamba ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Ndikuha oruzaaro nkukanyise nkwihemu amahanga maingi, kandi ensi enu, ndigiha abaijukuru bawe, ebe nsi yaabo ey'ebiro byona.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okuruga hati, batabani bawe ababiri, aba wazaaliire Misiri ntakakwebingire, bafokere baana bange. Efuraimu na Manaase baraaba bange nka Rubbeni na Simyoni oku bali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi abaana abandi obubalizara abo baliba bawe, balirukwa amabara ga bagenzi baabo nigaijukurana, nukwo batunge omugabo gw'obugwetwa bwabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.35.16+GEN.35.17+GEN.35.18+GEN.35.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 35:16-19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba obu nkaba ninduga Padani, tuli omu muhanda, omunsi Kanaani, tuli haihi kuhika Efurati nkaferwa nyoko Rakeeri, namuziika ha rubaju rw'oruguudo orunyakutwara Efurati, niyo Beterehemu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isirairi obu yaboine batabani ba Yosefu yakaguza ati: “Banu nibaha?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefu yagarukamu ise ati: “Abo nubo batabani bange, Ruhanga aba yampeeriire kunu.” Isirairi yagamba ati: “Banyirize haihi mbahe omugisa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kasumi ako, amaiso ga Isirairi gakaba gahimbaire, atakyahweza. Aho Yosefu yabamwiriza haihi, Isirairi yabanywegera kandi yababumbaatira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isirairi yagambira Yosefu ati: “Nkaba ntarukunihira kugaruka kukurora, baitu Ruhanga andoleze n'abaana bawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Yosefu yaiha abaana ha bibero bya isenkurubo, yajuumara hansi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefu yakwata abaana bombi, Efuraimu yamukwasa omukono ogw'obulyo, yamuta ha rubaju rw'emoso orwa Isirairi, kandi Manaase yamukwasa omukono ogw'emoso, yamuta ha rubaju orw'obulyo orwa Isirairi, yabamwiriza haihi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isirairi yagorra emikono ye, yagisoberaniza ogw'obulyo yaguta ha mutwe gw'Efuraimu omuto, kandi ogw'emoso, yaguta ha mutwe gwa Manaase, habwokuba Manaase nuwe akaba ali muzigaijo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaha Yosefu omugisa naagamba ati: “Ruhanga owa baisenkurwinywe, Abburahamu na Isaaka ou baaherezaaga, ayandinzire ira lyona okuhika na hati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "malaika ayanjunire obubi bwona, Ruhanga ogu, abaana banu abahe omugisa beeyongere bakanye muno omunsi, kandi ibara lyange, n'amabara aga baisenkuru-nyowe Abburahamu na Isaaka, galeke kweba ebiro byona.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefu obu yarozire ise naata omukono gwe ogw'obulyo ha mutwe gwa Efuraimu, yabiihirwa, yakwata omukono gwa ise, agwihe ha mutwe gwa Efuraimu, agute ha gwa Manaase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefu yagambira ise ati: “Taata, eki orukukora tikihikire, habwokuba, onu nuwe muzigaijo, nuwe oteho omukono gwawe ogw'obulyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu ise yayanga naagamba ati: “Mwana wange, nimmanya, mmanyire onu, na uwe alirugwamu abantu baingi, kandi aliba w'ekitiinisa, baitu muto we alimukiza ekitiinisa, kandi baijukuru be baliba ihanga likooto.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.11.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Baheb 11:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha kiro eki, bombi yabaha omugisa naagamba ati: “Abantu ab'omu Isirairi, obu baraabaga nibasaba omugisa, baraayaturaga amabara ganyu nibagamba bati: ‘Ruhanga atukorre nk'ebi yakoliire Efuraimu na Manaase.’ Yakobbo, nukwo yakulize ati Efuraimu, yamukiza mugenzi we Manaase.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Isirairi yagamba Yosefu ati: “Hati ndi haihi kufa, baitu Ruhanga araikaraga na iwe, kandi alikugarrayo omunsi eya baaswenkuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkuhaire orubaju rumu orw'orusozi, nakukizaaho bagenzi bawe ensi ei nabahaire, ei nanyagisize empirima n'obuta, naginyagaho Abamooli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
